sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant App as App
  participant AS as Auth server
  participant API as API
  U->>App: Sign in
  App->>App: verifier, challenge, state
  App->>U: redirect /authorize + challenge
  U->>AS: log in + consent
  AS->>U: redirect /callback?code&state
  U->>App: code + state (check state)
  App->>AS: POST /token: code + verifier
  AS-->>App: access, refresh, id tokens
  App->>API: Bearer access token
  API->>API: verify signature, iss, aud, exp
  API-->>App: 200
